<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-NSW BEAT CANTERBURY 25-8 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NSW BEAT CANTERBURY 25-8 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New South Wales beat Canterbury</p>
<p>25-8 (halftime 9-8) in a Super 12 rugby union match at the</p>
<p>Sydney Football Stadium on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New South Wales - Tries: Daniel Manu (2). Penalties: Matthew</p>
<p>Burke (5).</p>
<p>Canterbury - Try: Daryl Lilley. Penalty: Lilley.</p>
<p>Attendance: 22,268.</p>
</text>
